# VFP strings + process code CG

## Centerless grind = `CG`

- Process code is **`CG`**, not `CLG`.
- Captions/tooltips/prompts: `Cut/CG/UT...` (not Cut/CLG/...).
- SQL catalog `WorkOrder_ProcessCode`, ledger rows, burden `DefaultRateCode`, and `WO_Is_LbOnly_Process` must use `CG`.

## No fancy Unicode in VFP UI text

VFP/FoxBin often store captions as Windows-1252. UTF-8 punctuation becomes mojibake like `â€` / `â€¦`.

In `Forms\*.SC2`, `*.prg` captions, MessageBox/InputBox titles, and ToolTipText:

| Avoid | Use instead |
|-------|-------------|
| `…` (ellipsis) | `...` |
| `—` / `–` (em/en dash) | `-` |
| `'` `'` `"` `"` (smart quotes) | `'` `"` |
| `→` | `->` |

SQL comments/docs may keep Unicode; **VFP UI strings must stay ASCII**.
